(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "cloud-itonami-isic-6209 actor scope (narrowed from generic n.e.c. code to IT managed-services/helpdesk ticket-routing specifically)" "TicketRouter-LLM ⊣ TicketGovernor の単一不変条件" "access-tier-clearance-gate + security-incident-misrouting-gate HARD checks (新規、IT-support ticket-routing 固有)")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "cloud-itonami-isic-6209-it-support-actor"), (:adr/related (vector "adr-2607111500-cloud-itonami-isic-6311-market-data-actor" "adr-2607115300-cloud-itonami-isic-8299-bpo-task-matching-actor" "adr-2607112900-cloud-itonami-isic-7820-temp-staffing-actor")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607116700-cloud-itonami-isic-6209-it-support-actor"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/body "# ADR-2607116700: cloud-itonami-isic-6209 — その他IT/コンピュータサービス(narrowed: マネージドサービス/ヘルプデスク・チケットルーティング)を TicketRouter-LLM ⊣ TicketGovernor で実装する actor を新設\n\n**Status**: accepted\n**Date**: 2026-07-10\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki (+ Claude, オーナー承認のうえ実行)\n\n## Context\n\nオーナーの「成熟度を高めて」という指示のもと、`kotoba-lang/industry` registry\nの未着手 `:spec` スロットから複数件を選んで並列で actor を新設した(本ADRは\nその1件)。ISIC Rev.4 6209「Other information technology and computer\nservice activities」は n.e.c. の広いコードであり、`cloud-itonami-isic-6311`/\n`isic-4610`/`isic-8299` と同じ narrowing の作法で、**IT\nマネージドサービス/ヘルプデスクのチケットルーティング**へ具体的に絞った。\n\n## Decision\n\n新規 actor `cloud-itonami-isic-6209` を `cloud-itonami` org 直下に\npublic/AGPL-3.0-or-later で新設した。クライアントの IT インシデントを\nトリアージし、契約済みの technician プールへ access-tier とセキュリティ\nインシデント対応認定に基づいて割り当てるサービス。\n\n### TicketRouter-LLM ⊣ TicketGovernor(単一不変条件)\n\n> **TicketRouter-LLM は、TicketGovernor が拒否するルーティング確定・\n> 開示・紛争解決を決して行わない。**\n\n8チェック(HARD: rbac・**access-tier-clearance-gate**・\n**security-incident-misrouting-gate**・source-provenance-gate・\nlicensed-disclosure、SOFT: 確信度フロア・sla-breach-imminent gate・\ndispute-request 無条件)。\n\n`access-tier-clearance-gate`(NIST SP 800-53 AC-6 least-privilege 準拠の\n3段階 tier スケール)と `security-incident-misrouting-gate`(GIAC GCIH・\nCISSP・CHFI の実在3認定からなる閉じたカタログ)は他の cloud-itonami actor\nに存在しない domain-unique HARD チェック。決済は一切扱わず、雇用主責任も\n負わない(`cloud-itonami-isic-7820` の派遣モデルとは明確に異なる)。\n`default-phase` は実装当初から保守的な `1` を採用。\n\n## Consequences\n\n- (+) `kotoba-lang/industry` registry の 6209 スロットが実装へ昇格。\n  narrowing の判断を ADR に明記。\n- (+) `clojure -M:dev:test`: 26 tests / 82 assertions、0 failures。\n  `clojure -M:lint`: エラー0・警告0。`clojure -M:dev:run` デモも8シナリオ\n  全て正しく発火。\n- (-) R0 認定カタログは3種のみ(GIAC GCIH/CISSP/CHFI)。\n- superproject への反映: 本 ADR + `kotoba-lang/industry` pin 前進のみ。\n  `cloud-itonami-isic-6209` は standalone、plain-git 子リポとして\n  `manifest/repos.edn` には登録しない。\n\n## References\n\n- `orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-6209/README.edn` + `docs/adr/0001-architecture.md`\n- `90-docs/adr/2607111500-cloud-itonami-isic-6311-market-data-actor.edn`(フリート標準パターンの手本)\n- `orgs/kotoba-lang/industry/resources/kotoba/industry/registry.edn`(id \"6209\" エントリ)"), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/date "2026-07-10"), (:adr/amends (vector)), (:db/id -1), (:adr/decision-summary "{:pattern \"sealed TicketRouter-LLM + independent TicketGovernor + append-only audit ledger, triages/routes client IT-support tickets to already-contracted technicians -- never processes payroll, never employer-of-record (distinct from cloud-itonami-isic-7820's dispatch model)\", :new-actor \"cloud-itonami-isic-6209\", :org \"cloud-itonami\", :repo \"https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-6209\", :visibility :public, :license \"AGPL-3.0-or-later\", :isic-rev4 \"6209\", :isic-name \"Other information technology and computer service activities\", :narrowed-to \"IT managed-services/helpdesk ticket-routing, same narrowing move as isic-6311/isic-4610/isic-8299\", :namespace \"itsupport\", :registry-promotion \"kotoba-lang/industry registry.edn id 6209: :maturity :spec -> :implemented\", :governor-checks [{:check :rbac :severity :hard} {:check :access-tier-clearance-gate :severity :hard :note \"new -- no analog in other cloud-itonami actors; a NIST SP 800-53 AC-6 least-privilege 3-tier scale (standard/elevated/privileged), technician's access-tier must meet or exceed the ticket's required tier\"} {:check :security-incident-misrouting-gate :severity :hard :note \"new -- a :category :security-incident ticket can only route to a technician holding at least one of 3 real named incident-response certifications (GIAC GCIH, CISSP, CHFI)\"} {:check :source-provenance-gate :severity :hard} {:check :licensed-disclosure :severity :hard} {:check :confidence-floor :severity :soft-escalate} {:check :sla-breach-imminent-gate :severity :soft-escalate :note \"a ticket within 60 minutes of SLA breach always escalates to a human, regardless of confidence\"} {:check :dispute-request :severity :soft-escalate-unconditional}], :r0-scope {:source-classes [\"client-submitted-ticket\" \"monitoring-system-alert\" \"hr-verified-certification\"], :security-incident-cert-catalog [\"GIAC GCIH\" \"CISSP\" \"CHFI\"]}, :robotics {:value false, :key-present false, :rationale \"routes tickets to already-contracted technicians only; no physical action inside the actor's boundary\"}, :test-results {:unit-tests \"26 tests / 82 assertions, 0 failures\", :lint \"0 errors, 0 warnings\", :demo \"clojure -M:dev:run verified end-to-end, all 8 scenarios fire correctly\"}, :manifest-registration \"none -- standalone, per the existing cloud-itonami-{ISIC} blueprint convention. kotoba-lang/industry pin advanced in manifest/west.yml (--entry industry, verified via nbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs)\"}"), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607116700: cloud-itonami-isic-6209 — その他IT/コンピュータサービス(narrowed: マネージドサービス/ヘルプデスク・チケットルーティング)を TicketRouter-LLM ⊣ TicketGovernor で実装する actor を新設"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))